%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'primaryColor':'#E3F3EC','primaryBorderColor':'#0F8B6D','actorBkg':'#E3F3EC','actorBorder':'#0F8B6D'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Question
  participant D as Desk.submit
  participant F as Facts
  participant P as Pattern
  participant C as Compliance
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant R as Reviewer
  participant H as Human
  U->>D: raw text
  D->>D: pii.redact as the first line, raw text discarded
  par three agents run in parallel
    D->>F: redacted message
    D->>P: redacted message
    D->>C: redacted message
  end
  F-->>D: canonical bullet, or corpus fact with 1 link, or not_covered with what was searched
  P-->>D: one-off or recurring or rising, with counts and window
  C-->>D: PII types, advice asked?
  D->>O: three outputs
  O-->>D: reply (≤3 sentences) + routing note
  D->>R: draft
  alt fails a hard check
    R-->>O: failure codes (one rework round)
    O-->>R: second draft
  end
  R-->>H: passed, or flagged with approval disabled
  H->>H: edit (re-reviewed), approve or reject
